{"data": [{"author_id": "101267440", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:01:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114824752401420784"], "id": "2114824752401420784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SI/AI Brief, Oct 19. Four stories: Google's Gemini 4 Argon goes wide, Anthropic floats its own AI safety bill, China drafts AI export controls, and an OpenAI hire puts a number on distillation. I read the sources, not just the posts.", "url": "https://x.com/maxster/status/2114824752401420784"}, {"author_id": "1998799558848163842", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:10:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114857216293355607"], "id": "2114857216293355607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's AI chip restrictions created a cost collapse that US cloud providers didn't see coming.\n\nDeepSeek's R1 model trained for $294,000 in its final run — because export controls forced algorithmic efficiency rather than hardware scale. That efficiency is now spreading: Chinese", "url": "https://x.com/AbundanceEcon/status/2114857216293355607"}, {"author_id": "766569667116892160", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:06:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114841189689999383"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/k9MyADofwC", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/theobearman/status/2114841189689999383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114841177857863680", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/k9MyADofwC"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/k9MyADofwC", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/theobearman/status/2114841189689999383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114841178113822721", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/k9MyADofwC"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/k9MyADofwC", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/theobearman/status/2114841189689999383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114841177228804096", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/k9MyADofwC"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/k9MyADofwC", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/theobearman/status/2114841189689999383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114841177824411648", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/k9MyADofwC"}]}, "id": "2114841189689999383", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 3048, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Here are 7 AI risk-related things I learned today from Anthropic's S1 that I don't believe we already knew.\n\n1. Anthropic delayed a frontier pre-training run by over a month to improve defenses against model and IP theft.\n\n2. Anthropic states that there is a risk of models being https://t.co/k9MyADofwC", "url": "https://x.com/theobearman/status/2114841189689999383"}, {"author_id": "1511104418590048261", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:35:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114848497581297683"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Crypto_WarRoom…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Crypto_WarRoom/status/2104943253938229352", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/CV9NxJX1l6"}]}, "id": "2114848497581297683", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2104943253938229352", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Nice.\nSEC Chairman Paul Atkins on CNBC highlighting the agency’s work on tokenization and crypto rulemaking marks a clear break from the Biden-era approach. Under Biden, SEC Chair Gary Gensler treated most crypto assets as unregistered securities &amp; pursued regulation by https://t.co/CV9NxJX1l6", "url": "https://x.com/l_bohlman/status/2114848497581297683"}, {"author_id": "1823052485344600064", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:36:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114848743811879173"], "id": "2114848743811879173", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impressio